# Requests @Goobles as reviewer on every pull request.
#
# This is what puts release-please's `chore(main): release X.Y.Z` PRs into your
# review queue: they are authored by app/github-actions, not by you, so GitHub
# can request your review on them. (It never requests review from a PR's own
# author, so PRs you open yourself are unaffected — as they should be.)
#
# The ruleset on main has require_code_owner_review: false, so this requests a
# review without hard-blocking the merge. Set that to true if you want the
# review to be mandatory rather than advisory.

* @Goobles
